# id: BM17b-unregistered-wrapper
# blinds: the other direction of the same 1:1:1 -- a wrapper with no CallSite
# covering-lane: cpp-scan
# expect: killed
# control-lane: cpp-build
# expect-control: alive
#
# The second induced failure DESIGN-B1 names for B1.2a: delete one CallSite
# registration. A public wrapper that names no CallSite is an Env call the
# census cannot count and the sweep cannot identify -- "kill 47 failed" with
# nothing to say what call 47 was.
#
# The scanner catches it as an UNPARSED LINE rather than as a missing name, and
# that is deliberate: the grammar refuses to skip what it cannot classify, so
# the failure arrives even for a drift nobody anticipated the shape of.
